CORRECTED METAGRAPH EQUATIONS:
  T = SL_mine + non_SL
  non_SL >= 2*E (multi-edges possible)
  D >= SL_mine (orbit size correction)
  E = (T - SL_mine)/2 ONLY IF no multi-edges

